# What Bounce lets you change.
Options=size,speed
Option.size=int:32..192:96
Label.size=Logo size
Desc.size=Pixels. The artwork is drawn from a 64px master, so large is upscaled.
Step.size=16
Unit.size=px
Option.speed=int:2..12:3
Label.speed=Speed
Desc.speed=Pixels a frame across. The other axis is two thirds of it, so it still hits corners.
